      <title>Class of 2026 celebrates graduation at LSMSA’s 42nd Commencement Ceremony 5/19/2026</title>
            
      <link>https://www.lsmsa.edu/page/news-detail?pk=1679582&amp;nc=20751&amp;fromId=249284</link>
            
      <description>Eighty-nine seniors from the Louisiana School for Math, Science, and the Arts (LSMSA) graduated during the school’s 42nd Commencement Ceremony on May 16, 2026, in Prather Coliseum on the campus of Northwestern State University.</description>
            
      <guid>https://www.lsmsa.edu/page/news-detail?pk=1679582&amp;nc=20751&amp;fromId=249284</guid>
            
      <pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            
